# Fynla — Code Owners
#
# This file is used by GitHub to automatically request reviews from the right
# people when a pull request is opened. When combined with branch protection
# rules that require code-owner approval, it ensures every change to the
# protected branches (`main`, `dev`) is reviewed by the project lead.
#
# Syntax reference:
#   https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# The pattern `*` matches every file in the repository. @Stoff73 is the sole
# reviewer required for any PR — contributors (icecube-acc, Phailanx) cannot
# self-approve or approve each other's work into `dev` or `main`.

*  @Stoff73
